(doc
  (title "Step 0: Swift Build Configuration")
  (source-format markdown)
  (converted "2026-07-19")
  (kv "Version" "0.1.0")
  (kv "Step ID" "ybs-step_000000000000")
  (section
    (heading "Overview")
    (para "Collect all configuration parameters for building the YX Swift implementation and set up the build workspace. After this step, all subsequent steps run autonomously with zero user interaction."))
  (section
    (heading "What This Step Builds")
    (para "A `builds/<build_name>/` workspace containing `BUILD_CONFIG.json`, `BUILD_STATUS.sxp`, and `SESSION.md`, plus the initial directory scaffolding for a Swift Package Manager project. This is the foundation all other steps build on top of."))
  (section
    (heading "Step Objectives")
    (item "1. Check for existing `BUILD_CONFIG.json` — skip questions if found")
    (item "2. Collect: build name, Swift version")
    (item "3. Verify canonical artifacts exist (`canonical/test-vectors/`)")
    (item "4. Create `builds/<build_name>/` directory tree")
    (item "5. Write `BUILD_CONFIG.json` with all collected values")
    (item "6. Write `BUILD_STATUS.sxp` with initial progress tracking")
    (item "7. Write `SESSION.md` for crash recovery")
    (item "8. Point to Step 1 (`ybs-step_a1b2c3d4e5f6`)"))
  (section
    (heading "Prerequisites")
    (item "Python implementation complete (`canonical/python/` exists)")
    (item "Canonical test vectors exist (`canonical/test-vectors/*.json`)")
    (item "Swift 5.9+ installed (`swift --version`)")
    (item "Swift Package Manager available"))
  (section
    (heading "Configurable Values")
    (item "`{{CONFIG:build_name|string|Build directory name|swift-impl}}`")
    (item "`{{CONFIG:swift_version|string|Minimum Swift version|5.9}}`"))
  (section
    (heading "Traceability")
    (para "**Implements**:")
    (item "`swift/specs/technical/ybs-spec_6c4f2a8d1e7b.sxp` FR-1 (SPM structure setup)")
    (item "YBS methodology — Step 0: Configuration Collection")
    (para "**References**:")
    (item "`protocol/specs/technical/yx-protocol-spec.sxp`")
    (item "`swift/specs/testing/ybs-spec_9e1b3c6a4f2d.sxp`"))
  (section
    (heading "Instructions")
    (subsection
      (heading "Before Starting — Record Start Time")
      (para "Record the current timestamp in ISO 8601 format: `YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ`"))
    (subsection
      (heading "1. Verify Prerequisites")
      (code "# Check canonical artifacts exist
test -d canonical/test-vectors && echo \"✓ canonical/test-vectors exists\" || echo \"✗ MISSING — build Python implementation first\"

# Check Swift is available
swift --version && echo \"✓ Swift available\" || echo \"✗ Swift not found\"")
      (para "If canonical test vectors are missing, STOP and instruct the user to complete the Python build first."))
    (subsection
      (heading "2. Check for Existing Configuration")
      (code "test -f builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/BUILD_CONFIG.json && echo \"EXISTS\"")
      (para "**If BUILD_CONFIG.json exists:** read it, skip questions, proceed to Step 1."))
    (subsection
      (heading "3. Collect Configuration Values")
      (para "**Question 1: Build directory name**")
      (code "Build name (default: swift-impl):
Examples: swift-impl, dev, experiment-1")
      (para "**Question 2: Swift version**")
      (code "Minimum Swift version (default: 5.9):
Examples: 5.9, 5.10"))
    (subsection
      (heading "4. Create Build Directory Structure")
      (code "mkdir -p builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/docs/build-history
mkdir -p builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/Sources/YXProtocol/Primitives
mkdir -p builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/Sources/YXProtocol/Transport
mkdir -p builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/Sources/SwiftSender
mkdir -p builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/Sources/SwiftReceiver
mkdir -p builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/Tests/YXProtocolTests/Unit
mkdir -p builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/Tests/YXProtocolTests/Integration"))
    (subsection
      (heading "5. Create BUILD_CONFIG.json")
      (para "Create `builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/BUILD_CONFIG.json`:")
      (code "{
  \"version\": \"1.0\",
  \"generated\": \"<ISO 8601 timestamp>\",
  \"system\": \"yx-swift\",
  \"ybs_version\": \"2.0.0\",
  \"values\": {
    \"build_name\": \"{{CONFIG:build_name}}\",
    \"language\": \"swift\",
    \"swift_version\": \"{{CONFIG:swift_version}}\"
  },
  \"metadata\": {
    \"step_sequence\": \"swift\",
    \"config_sources\": [\"ybs-step_000000000000\"],
    \"protocol_specs\": \"protocol/specs/\",
    \"impl_specs\": \"swift/specs/\",
    \"canonical_artifacts\": \"canonical/test-vectors/\"
  }
}"))
    (subsection
      (heading "6. Create BUILD_STATUS.sxp")
      (para "Create `builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/BUILD_STATUS.sxp`:")
      (code "# Build Status: {{CONFIG:build_name}}

**System**: yx-swift
**Language**: Swift {{CONFIG:swift_version}}+
**Started**: <timestamp>
**Last Updated**: <timestamp>
**Status**: 🔄 IN PROGRESS

## Progress

- [x] Step 0: Build Configuration
- [ ] Step 1: Project Setup              (ybs-step_a1b2c3d4e5f6)
- [ ] Step 2: GUID Factory               (ybs-step_b2c3d4e5f6a1)
- [ ] Step 3: Packet Structure           (ybs-step_c3d4e5f6a1b2)
- [ ] Step 4: HMAC Computation           (ybs-step_d4e5f6a1b2c3)
- [ ] Step 5: Packet Builder             (ybs-step_e5f6a1b2c3d4)
- [ ] Step 6-8: UDP Socket + Send/Recv   (ybs-step_f6a1b2c3d4e5)
- [ ] Step 9: Canonical Validation       (ybs-step_a2b3c4d5e6f7)
- [ ] Step 10: Integration Tests         (ybs-step_b3c4d5e6f7a2)
- [ ] Step 11: Protocol 0 (Text)         (ybs-step_g1h2i3j4k5l6)
- [ ] Step 12: Protocol 1 (Binary)       (ybs-step_h2i3j4k5l6m7)
- [ ] Step 13: Security                  (ybs-step_i3j4k5l6m7n8)
- [ ] Step 14: SimplePacketBuilder       (ybs-step_j4k5l6m7n8o9)
- [ ] Step 15: Interop Tests             (ybs-step_k5l6m7n8o9p0)

## Metrics

| Metric | Value |
|---|---|
| Steps Completed | 1 / 15 |
| Tests Passing | 0 / 0 |
| Code Coverage | 0% |
| Canonical Vectors Passing | 0 / N |

## Issues

None."))
    (subsection
      (heading "7. Create SESSION.md")
      (para "Create `builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/SESSION.md`:")
      (code "# Session: {{CONFIG:build_name}}

**System**: yx-swift
**Build**: {{CONFIG:build_name}}
**Started**: <timestamp>
**Last Updated**: <timestamp>

## Current Status

Step 0 complete. Ready to execute Step 1 (Project Setup).

## Configuration

- Language: Swift {{CONFIG:swift_version}}+
- Build dir: builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/

## Next Actions

1. Execute `swift/steps/ybs-step_a1b2c3d4e5f6.sxp` (Step 1: Project Setup)
2. Follow step sequence in `swift/steps/STEPS_ORDER.txt`
3. Update BUILD_STATUS.sxp and this file after each step"))
    (subsection
      (heading "8. Display Summary")
      (code "✓ Configuration complete!

  System:        yx-swift
  Build name:    {{CONFIG:build_name}}
  Build dir:     builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/
  Swift:         {{CONFIG:swift_version}}+
  Canonical:     canonical/test-vectors/ ✓

→ Next: swift/steps/ybs-step_a1b2c3d4e5f6.sxp (Step 1: Project Setup)")))
  (section
    (heading "Verification")
    (para "**This step is complete when:**")
    (item "[ ] `builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/BUILD_CONFIG.json` exists and is valid JSON")
    (item "[ ] `builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/BUILD_STATUS.sxp` exists")
    (item "[ ] `builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/SESSION.md` exists")
    (item "[ ] SPM directory structure (`Sources/`, `Tests/`) exists")
    (item "[ ] `canonical/test-vectors/` confirmed present")
    (para "**Verification Commands:**")
    (code "python3 -m json.tool builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/BUILD_CONFIG.json > /dev/null && \\
  echo \"✓ BUILD_CONFIG.json valid\"
test -f builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/BUILD_STATUS.sxp && echo \"✓ BUILD_STATUS.sxp exists\"
test -d builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/Sources && echo \"✓ Sources/ exists\"
test -d builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/Tests && echo \"✓ Tests/ exists\"
test -d canonical/test-vectors && echo \"✓ canonical/test-vectors/ present\"")
    (para "**Retry Policy:**")
    (item "Maximum 3 attempts")
    (item "If canonical test vectors missing: STOP, do not proceed without them")
    (item "After 3 failures: STOP and report to user"))
  (section
    (heading "Documentation")
    (para "Create `builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/docs/build-history/ybs-step_000000000000-DONE.txt`:")
    (code "STEP ybs-step_000000000000: Swift Build Configuration
STARTED:    [start timestamp]
COMPLETED:  [end timestamp]
DURATION:   [minutes]

OBJECTIVES COMPLETED:
- Prerequisites verified (canonical artifacts present)
- Configuration collected (or loaded from existing BUILD_CONFIG.json)
- Build directory structure created
- BUILD_CONFIG.json, BUILD_STATUS.sxp, SESSION.md written

VERIFICATION: PASSED (attempt [N])

NEXT STEP: ybs-step_a1b2c3d4e5f6 (Project Setup)"))
  (section
    (heading "Success Criteria")
    (item "1. All verification checks pass including canonical artifacts present")
    (item "2. Agent can read BUILD_CONFIG.json values for Steps 1-15")
    (item "3. DONE file created")
    (item "4. No user interaction required for any subsequent step"))
  (section
    (heading "Next Steps")
    (kv "Next" "`ybs-step_a1b2c3d4e5f6` — Project Setup"))
  (section
    (heading "Version History")
    (subsection
      (heading "0.1.0 (2026-04-11)")
      (item "Initial creation, Swift-specific Step 0 (split from shared Step 0)"))))
